  <x:String x:Key="page.st.loaded">{0} shaders ({1}){2}</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="page.st.empty">The shader library is empty.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="page.st.emptyHint">The data root has neither presets/*.shaderx nor shadertoy.db (current: {0}). Put .shaderx (or db + media/) into shadertoy\ next to the exe, or point --shadertoy-data at a folder.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="page.st.changeNoPass">⚠ The change has no playable pass; keeping the current frame</x:String>
